      "writtenOn": "2020-03-26T12:51:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Resetting the variable in a loop is confusing, I\u0027d move it out of loop:\n  imageLocations :\u003d bootImage.getVariant(targets[0]).imageLocations()\n\nWhen you say \"identical per-OS\", do you mean (1) that all locations for the same OS are identical (like arm and arm64 for OS android), or (2) that locations of different OS-es are the same? Initially I read your comment as (2), but I think (2) is incorrect and you mean (1).\n\nIn any case, this code seems to use the same location for all OSes. This looks wrong, why should location for the image on host be the same as on device?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 158,
        "startChar": 2,
